      "category": "Reasoning",
      "question": "[Sample] In a certain code language, if \"PRACTICE\" is written as \"16-18-1-3-20-9-3-5\", how will \"SUCCESS\" be written in that code?",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में यदि \"PRACTICE\" को \"16-18-1-3-20-9-3-5\" लिखा जाता है, तो \"SUCCESS\" को कैसे लिखा जाएगा?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "19-21-3-3-5-19-19"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "19-20-3-3-5-19-19"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "18-21-3-3-5-18-18"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "19-21-4-4-5-19-19"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "explanation": "Each letter is represented by its standard alphabetical position: S=19, U=21, C=3, C=3, E=5, S=19, S=19.",
      "exam": {
        "name": "SSC CGL",
        "year": 2024,
        "shift": "Shift 1"
      },
