      "category": "Reasoning",
      "question": "[Sample] If in a code language, \"MIND\" is coded as \"KGLB\", then how is \"DIAGRAM\" coded in the same language?",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] यदि किसी कूट भाषा में \"MIND\" को \"KGLB\" के रूप में कोडित किया जाता है, तो \"DIAGRAM\" को कैसे कोडित किया जाएगा?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "BGYEPYK"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "BGYEPYL"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "CGYEPYK"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "BGYFQYK"
        }
