      },
      "category": "Reasoning",
      "question": "[Sample] In a certain code, \"253\" means \"books are old\", \"546\" means \"man is old\", and \"378\" means \"buy good books\". What digit stands for \"are\"?",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] एक निश्चित कूट में \"253\" का अर्थ \"books are old\", \"546\" का अर्थ \"man is old\" और \"378\" का अर्थ \"buy good books\" है। \"are\" के लिए कौन सा अंक है?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "4"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "explanation": "5 = \"old\" (common in 253 and 546), 3 = \"books\" (common in 253 and 378). Remaining in 253 is 2 = \"are\".",
      "exam": {
        "name": "SSC Stenographer",
        "year": 2023,
        "shift": "Shift 1"
      },
